    "question": "How should grouping be configured in the current TanStack Table API?",
    "answer": "In the current API, the legacy function is replaced by createGroupedRowModel() registered in the groupedRowModel feature slot. The table then exposes the grouped row model through its instance.",
    "followUp": "How does server-side grouping differ? Set manualGrouping to true and supply already-grouped rows; the table will not perform client-side grouping."
   },
   {
    "question": "What does the grouped row model do?",
