    "followUp": "Does the same rule apply across QueryClient fetching APIs? Query options are shared by observers and QueryClient methods, so the configured query function is used wherever those options apply."
   }
  ],
  "keyPoints": [
   "queryFn defines how TanStack Query obtains the query's data.",
   "Its single input is a QueryFunctionContext object.",
   "The function may return the data directly or return a promise of that data.",
   "Defaults configured on the QueryClient can provide the function when an option-level function is absent."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
