    "answer": "The final row model is produced after the enabled row-model stages process the data. The documented pipeline can include filtering, grouping, sorting, expanding, and pagination before getRowModel returns the result.",
    "followUp": "Why should rendering normally use getRowModel? Because it represents the final output after the applicable feature transformations."
   },
